[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316710926","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110764#issuecomment-3316710926","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110764","id":3316710926,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FsP4O","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-22T04:19:41Z","updated_at":"2025-09-22T04:19:41Z","body":"See also:\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/391\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/74618\r\n\r\nLast time, we stopped because of the issue of late static binding: should `Self` simply be an alias for the current class (in which the function, variable, etc. is defined) or should it also point to child classes in the case of method inheritance? PHP, for example, has two keywords for this purpose: `self` and `static`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316710926/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316736730","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110764#issuecomment-3316736730","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110764","id":3316736730,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FsWLa","user":{"login":"Macksaur","id":86566939,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTY2OTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86566939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur","html_url":"https://github.com/Macksaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-22T04:35:22Z","updated_at":"2025-09-22T04:41:11Z","body":"There is definitely value in having both. It would be a shame to start bikeshedding though. I am only interested in the non-runtime-form at present, and referring to the enclosing class.\r\n\r\nPerhaps the future version of late static binding can be represented by another name? and this issue can be deferred? If not, it will be easy enough to rename this version's `Self` to something else. There's lots of possibilities.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316736730/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused"